"transactional, as if they were annotated with `@Transactional`. This is a\n"
"convenient default for resolvers that read from or write to a database."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A method receives this implicit `@Transactional` only when all of the\n"
"following are true:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `TRANSACTIONS` capability is present (a JTA extension is on the "
"classpath)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
